    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a senior SEO keyword researcher with 10 years of experience.\n\nBusiness Profile:\n{{ $('Structure Business Profile').item.json.businessProfile }}\n\nCompetitor Data from Google:\n{{ $('Formatting Competitor Data').item.json.competitorData }}\n\nYour task:\n1. Identify 20 high-potential keywords for this business based on the profile and competitor data\n2. For each keyword provide: search intent (informational/commercial/transactional), estimated difficulty (low/medium/high), best content type, and reason why it suits this business\n3. Filter down to the BEST 10 final keywords\n4. Include at least 3 long-tail keywords optimized for voice search and AEO (Answer Engine Optimization)\n5. Include at least 2 keywords with local or entity signals suitable for GEO (Generative Engine Optimization)\n6. Choose one as the recommended primary keyword — the one with the best opportunity\n\nOutput ONLY valid JSON. No explanation. No markdown code blocks. Just the JSON:\n{\n  \"top10Keywords\": [\n    {\n      \"keyword\": \"\",\n      \"intent\": \"\",\n      \"difficulty\": \"\",\n      \"contentType\": \"\",\n      \"reason\": \"\",\n      \"isLongTail\": false,\n      \"isGEO\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"recommendedPrimaryKeyword\": \"\",\n  \"clusterGroups\": {\n    \"group1\": [],\n    \"group2\": []\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b30cf88c-7f55-46f9-bb20-2b10214a6dd5",
      "name": "Keyword Research Agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.advancedAgent",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2230,
        -20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "id": "b30cf88c-7f55-46f9-bb20-2b10214a6dd4",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model (GPT-4o-mini, Temp 0.3)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2230,
        140
