    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a professional SEO blog outline architect.\n\nPrimary Keyword: {{ JSON.parse($('Keyword Research Agent').item.json.output.replace(/```json\\n?/g, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim()).recommendedPrimaryKeyword }}\n\nBusiness Profile:\n{{ $('Structure Business Profile').item.json.businessProfile }}\n\nTop Ranking Competitor Articles for this keyword:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.organic_results) }}\n\nYour task:\nCreate a complete, highly detailed SEO blog outline that will outrank these competitor articles.\n\nInclude:\n- A compelling, keyword-optimized title (H1)\n- A strong meta description under 160 characters\n- A hook introduction paragraph outline\n- At least 6 H2 sections with supporting H3 sub-points where relevant\n- A detailed FAQ section with 5 questions and answer outlines (for AEO)\n- A strong conclusion with a clear CTA\n- Estimated word count\n\nOutput ONLY valid JSON. No explanation. No markdown:\n{\n  \"title\": \"\",\n  \"metaDescription\": \"\",\n  \"introduction\": \"\",\n  \"h2Sections\": [\n    {\n      \"heading\": \"\",\n      \"keyPoints\": [],\n      \"h3Subsections\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"faqSection\": [\n    { \"question\": \"\", \"answerOutline\": \"\" }\n  ],\n  \"conclusion\": \"\",\n  \"cta\": \"\",\n  \"estimatedWordCount\": 0\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b30cf88c-7f55-46f9-bb20-2b10214a6dd9",
      "name": "Blog Outline Agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.advancedAgent",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2950,
        -120
      ]
    },
