        3200,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a professional SEO content writer and subject matter expert.\n\nBlog Outline:\n{{ $('Assembling Blog Blueprint').item.json.blogBlueprint }}\n\nBusiness Profile:\n{{ $('Structure Business Profile').item.json.businessProfile }}\n\nBlog Topic: {{ $('SEO Brief Form').item.json['Blog Topic Preference (optional)'] }}\n\nYour task:\nWrite a complete, detailed, high-quality SEO blog post following the outline above.\n\nRules:\n- Write in the brand tone specified in the business profile\n- Use the primary keyword naturally in the title, first paragraph, at least two H2s, and the conclusion\n- Use secondary keywords and LSI terms throughout\n- Write at minimum 1500 words — ideally 2000+\n- Every H2 section should have at least 3 solid paragraphs\n- The FAQ section must have 5 questions with complete, direct answers (optimized for featured snippets)\n- Include a strong introduction with a hook that addresses the reader's pain point\n- End with a clear call to action directing readers to the business website or service\n- Write like a real human expert — no robotic phrases, no filler content, no AI clichés\n- Do not use phrases like \"In conclusion\", \"In today's digital world\", \"It is important to note\"\n\nWrite the full blog post now.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b30cf88c-7f55-46f9-bb20-2b10214a6ddc",
      "name": "SEO Blog Writer Agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.advancedAgent",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        3420,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b30cf88c-7f55-46f9-bb20-2b10214a6ddb",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model (GPT-4o, Writer)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3420,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a senior SEO editor specializing in AEO (Answer Engine Optimization) and GEO (Generative Engine Optimization).\n\nHere is the blog post to optimize:\n{{ $json.output }}\n\nBusiness Profile:\n{{ $('Structure Business Profile').item.json.businessProfile }}\n\nYour task — make the following improvements:\n\nSEO Optimization:\n- Ensure the primary keyword appears in the first 100 words\n- Ensure keyword density is between 1% and 2% — not keyword stuffed\n- Add or improve internal linking suggestions (note as [INTERNAL LINK: topic])\n- Ensure all H2 and H3 headings are optimized with relevant keywords\n- Add a proper meta title and meta description at the top if missing\n\nAEO Optimization (for Google Featured Snippets and AI answer boxes):\n- Reformat FAQ answers to be direct, concise, and start with the question keyword\n- Add at least 2 \"definition-style\" paragraphs that directly answer a question in 2-3 sentences\n- Add a \"Quick Answer\" box at the top after the introduction\n\nGEO Optimization (for ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google SGE):\n- Add entity mentions — specific brand names, location names, people, statistics\n- Add at least 3 factual statements with numbers or percentages\n- Add a \"Sources and References\" section at the bottom with placeholder links\n\nReturn the complete improved blog post. Keep all original content — only enhance and add.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b30cf88c-7f55-46f9-bb20-2b10214a6dde",
      "name": "SEO Editor / AEO / GEO Optimizer",
