        "text": "=You are a professional DALL-E image prompt writer.\n\nHere is data extracted from a blog post:\n{{ $json.output }}\n\nWrite a single, detailed DALL-E image generation prompt for the blog's featured image.\n\nRequirements:\n- The image should be editorial and professional\n- No text, words, or letters in the image\n- Style: clean, modern, flat illustration or photorealistic depending on the topic\n- The image should visually represent the blog topic\n- Mention specific colors, composition, mood, and elements\n- Keep the prompt under 200 words\n\nReturn only the image prompt. Nothing else.",
        "options": {}
